WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.342
<v Grandma>Maknae, let's go to the store.

00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:07.374
<v Maknae>Of course, Grandma. I'll go with you.

00:00:09.974 --> 00:00:14.472
<v Daughter>Looks like Mom's going to the store. I'll call her later.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.940
<v Grandma>Oh!

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.146
<v Maknae>Grandma, are you all right? I'll wait here.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.994
<v Grandma>I'm all right. Maknae, cancel the alert.

00:00:46.394 --> 00:00:50.436
<v Maknae>I've canceled it. Take your time getting up.

00:00:53.936 --> 00:00:55.338
<v Maknae>I'll follow you again!
